{"title":"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_MadMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by MadMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/3/f13a96240c51d61ba3733d9f5c3020fa92ec4136.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCDE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" /> be a nonconvex pentagon with internal angles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/1/e91651055824267bed085a6545fdaea4aba6268a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A = \\angle E = 90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/2/70257cb18683be3b5db2d313f27f6021e0ed6524.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B = \\angle D = 45^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"132\" height=\"15\" />. Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/3/d33be58fe302e89a05b18a2005b7fecdd9c1421a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE &lt; AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/b/bab47f85f86abad797b89c52f9b58a76fcf9a0b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/b/59b3ca4ad8ca3a575a626118620dbf835f5134e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = 14\\sqrt2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"97\" height=\"21\" />, and points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> lie on the same side of line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a65c05bd85d2609bea5db2b109ed5f556463511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" />. Suppose further that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> is an integer with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/4/ea4e5b06a4259cb53a1fa2c1f94506b9c0e971d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB &lt; 2026$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"15\" /> and the area of pentagon <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/3/f13a96240c51d61ba3733d9f5c3020fa92ec4136.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCDE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" /> is an integer multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Find the number of possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/8/c4864786f0a8b0dacb21e73d01adac7cf4091008.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(7cm); import geometry; pair A = (0,0); pair E = (20,0); pair B = (0, 17); pair D = (20, 9); pair C = (14, 3); draw(A--B--C--D--E--cycle); draw(A--E, dashed); dot(A); dot(B); dot(C); dot(D); dot(E); label(&quot;A&quot;, A, SW); label(&quot;B&quot;, B, W); label(&quot;C&quot;, C, N); label(&quot;D&quot;, D, N); label(&quot;E&quot;, E, SE); markrightangle(E,A,B); markrightangle(D,E,A); markangle(A,B,C, radius=10); markangle(C,D,E, radius=10); label(&quot;$20$&quot;, midpoint(A--E), S); label(&quot;$14\\sqrt{2}$&quot;, midpoint(B--C), NE);[/asy]\" width=\"332\" height=\"278\" />\n</p><p>~Diagram by sillybone\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Construct line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/5/3951902c11a1cd39a091ea15f0f06cbc79095de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> such that it passes through point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and is parallel to line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a65c05bd85d2609bea5db2b109ed5f556463511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/7/3572ba7ab0ef0774cc696bd9940d7226c50cef3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FG||AE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/3/5b3e97c5911c954ccae31b08f8ad844b1a4feaba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BFC = \\angle A = 90^\\circ.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"164\" height=\"15\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/3/bb39c71b0486a696e8b97f71024f558fd853821d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B = 45^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" />, triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/b/f6bab865ddf3fe5b09b3f223ed56527efe747af1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BFC$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/2/22231a5cdd4fe05a11f4b577e3b81221f3017a85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45-45-90$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"98\" height=\"13\" /> triangle, meaning that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/b/14b01ab65f70fc43bf6b758d5915fcde40a08369.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FC=14,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/c/6fc53fad97dfd92f055f7226de33299f7ff59232.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CG=6.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"14\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/3/bb39c71b0486a696e8b97f71024f558fd853821d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B = 45^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/7/e1750654d58bc5c6cfff2ee210190810bdc7f8de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DGC=90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" /> from parallel lines, triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/0/e808c409da9bc000faa5e4661341d2cec5df1c14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle DCG \\sim{\\triangle BCF}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" /> Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/f/85fab7cdcd977e63595aca87e843721e197d6bcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BF=FC=14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"126\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/c/9dceabac42d3fef487c764b248fea31521f4814a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CG=GD=6.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"123\" height=\"14\" /> If we set the length of segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/d/c9daba06f5ec9c5069f24bbeab9c7151ab4f68c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we can get the area of pentagon <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/3/f13a96240c51d61ba3733d9f5c3020fa92ec4136.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCDE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/1/3c15d666ae34fe7ca29385537802dd0b814d25b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$116+20x.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/1/051ae3e03eb7ea269ed9600e4b77e59cde08a147.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$116+20x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" /> must be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4c223ad63552411358549423293dd834b2ce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16, x\\equiv 3\\mod{4}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"139\" height=\"18\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/5/9956aea3f90aff2eb57496850f2247a5dd0729c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+14&lt;2026, x&lt;2012.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"197\" height=\"17\" /> We can express <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/0/df0229adf52c0df1a45c8fa2bff9db39b11c4a49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4y+3,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"57\" height=\"17\" /> so therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/c/58c43d6916cc16899795590768dec7883bfd77f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4y+3&lt;2012,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"17\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7cedae53ca6b0bfe03d6d6d6b2e47d9d686e51e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4y&lt;2009.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" /> Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/4/914fd018689f87001c219804ec2aaad3f04c8dd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y\\ge0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" /> solving the first inequality gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/c/4bcbdc5620a9aac32a13a9369cee9fa60838123d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&lt;502\\frac{1}{4},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"38\" /> meaning that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/5/f9503a3dc95a79e43cd29b4b87eaea67d2a3fd53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le y \\le 502.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"17\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> must be an integer, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/3/7d3817057d16af06717c17f3803fa0d447eb2347.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$503$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/1/8d1d002db36c51a77f8fbc6314e96756fc793e28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"11\" /> giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/b/82b06433bf3749ab1091dd79f50ddcb5cb99c8e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{503}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" /> possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ecee609050b0744995a1b79ec0fcd162a97441b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB.$\" width=\"32\" height=\"13\" /> \n</p><p>~Nodskin Goble (minor edit by Shandilya123)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_MadMath\">Video Solution by MadMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by MadMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ibMkxRhf3PA\">https://youtu.be/ibMkxRhf3PA</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II\" title=\"2026 AIME II\">2026 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2026 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2026\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018023835\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 322/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1471/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9370/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.229      1 Template:AIME_box\n100.00%    7.229      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35485:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018023835 and revision id 292044. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}